  "question": "Select the set in which the numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers of the following set.\n\n(NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into its constituent digits.)\n\n(13, 39, 6)\n\n(9, 18, 4)",
