  "solution": "The logic here follows is :\n\n**(2nd Number ÷ 1st Number) x 2 = 3rd Number**\n\nFor, (13, 39, 6) \n\n⇒ (39 ÷ 13) x 2 = 6\n\n⇒ 3 x 2 = 6.\n\nFor, (9, 18, 4)\n\n⇒ (18 ÷ 9) x 2 = 4\n\n⇒ 2 x 2 = 4.\n\n**By checking the options,**\n\n1. **(12, 48, 8)**\n\n**⇒ (48 ÷ 12) x 2 = 8**\n\n**⇒ 4 x 2 = 8**\n\n2. (12, 50, 13)\n\n⇒ (50 ÷ 12) x 2 = 13\n\n⇒ 4.1 x 2 = 13\n\n⇒ 8.2 ≠ 13\n\n3. (15, 45, 3)\n\n⇒ (45 ÷ 15) x 2 = 3\n\n⇒ 3 x 2 = 3\n\n⇒ 6 ≠ 3\n\n4. (20, 28, 8)\n\n⇒ (28 ÷ 20) x 2 = 8\n\n⇒ 1.4 x 2 = 8\n\n⇒ 2.8 ≠ 8\n\nHence, the correct answer is __**\"Option 1\"**__**.**",
